OL,3,GNEWSAFamily tribute to 'kind and
OL,4,Ahonest' e-biker, 19
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage e-biker fatally injured two
OL,7,Fmonths ago has been described by his
OL,8,Ffamily as a "young man of kindness,
OL,9,Fhonesty and quiet strength".
OL,11,FThe 19-year-old victim, named as
OL,12,FAhmadzai Safi, died shortly after being
OL,13,Ffound with serious injuries when police
OL,14,Fwere called to reports of a collision
OL,15,Fin Dallow Road, Luton, on 18 September.
OL,17,FBedfordshire Police said four men have
OL,18,Fnow been arrested in connection with
OL,19,Fassisting an offender, while two men
OL,20,Fhave been charged with murder.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
